From a690639becd54b23b3517ac932c27697a7f7eae8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 02:36:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11162/11171] feat(arc): retain bounded induction state

Reuse prior candidate failures without unbounded prompt growth.
REQ-ARC-WMTE-7040 through 7042; local-only and default off.

155 CPU tests and 64 assertion mutations pass with cmp restores.
Whole-tree collection exposes eight unrelated import errors;
no GPU efficacy claim or historical evidence rewrite.

The collection interlock flagged concurrent authored flag-ledger
and E2E-plan edits, with no writes attributed to tests. Both diffs
were reviewed and its marker retired by the documented intended-
edit procedure. Preserve those edits in this commit.

The first commit hook refused missing ignored eval artifacts in
this worktree. Expose its existing runs-dir option through the
environment, retaining failure checks and local source inspection.
The retry reads existing main-checkout evidence without copying it.
